    <h2>Research</h2>
    <p>Social media platforms have altered longstanding power relations between politicians, the media, and citizens. What this means for democracy remains an open question. My research explores how politicians and citizens leverage social media to campaign during elections. Empirically, I focus on the European Union and United States.</p>
    <p>Apart from electoral campaigning, I have conducted studies on disinformation, cyberattacks, Euroscepticism, and populism. I am passionate about research dissemination and do my utmost to accommodate speaking requests. You can reach me via the <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
